{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026f0cIfPCJQj1793615331.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，市場氣氛造好，上車盤持續錄得承接。元朗區本月錄得約63宗二手買賣成交，預計全月成交量與上月的70宗相若。元朗廣場新近錄得低層H室成交，實用面積427平方呎，兩房間隔，開價450萬元，議價後以440萬元易手，實用呎價10304元。</p><p> </p><p> </p><p>王勤學指，買家為上車客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即入市作自用。業主於2014年12月以355萬元買入單位，持貨約12年，賬面獲利85萬元，單位期內升值24%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:13.536045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:38:15.053745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:21.528286+00:00","content_hash":"ddc3bb0adb60a53d4141c3a164dd4afe1373357d537d0ef2b6a431ea0421e74c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:13.536045+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}